WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.600
An EQ shapes the tone of a track. Add Facet EQ to an empty slot of the chords.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.600
The graph shows the sound. Double-click to add a band.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.400
Make it a low cut: it removes the rumble under the bass.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:26.200
Add a band near 300 hertz and drag it down a little: less mud.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:32.000
A small lift near 3 kilohertz brings the notes forward.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:38.600
Compare: Source plays the track without the EQ, at the same loudness.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:44.400
Small moves are enough. Listen more than you look.
